WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.580 line:73%
May solar ka, pero may
Meralco bill ka pa rin?

c02
00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:05.860 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.660 line:73%
Sa typical
self-consumption setup,

c04
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:12.290 line:73%
tumutulong ang solar sa
daytime electricity use mo.

c05
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:14.740 line:73%
Pero kapag kulang
ang solar generation,

c06
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.710 line:73%
o gabi na at wala
kang battery,

c07
00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.020 line:73%
puwede ka pa ring kumuha
ng kuryente sa grid.

c08
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.100 line:73%
May mga bill charges din
na hindi basta nawawala.

c09
00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:25.720 line:73%
Kaya hindi dapat mangako
ng automatic zero bill.

c10
00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.650 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

c11
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.020 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
